WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.870
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:04.320
 You don't become good
because you think you're good.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.252
 ANNOUNCER: Wayne
Gretzky, "the Great One",

00:00:06.252 --> 00:00:09.000
has become the
greatest of them all!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.360
 You become good because you're
committed to becoming better

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.070
each and every day.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.200
I wasn't the biggest
player in the NHL,

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.820
and I didn't have
the hardest shot.

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:19.950
But what I had was a
will to want to score.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.950
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.510
If I got one goal, I wanted two.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:25.830
If I had two, I wanted three.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.027
It never stopped.

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.610
Through this
MasterClass, you're going

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:31.980
to learn you have to
have a belief in what you

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.690
want to accomplish.

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:36.630
You don't have to be an athlete
to make an athlete's mindset

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.280
work for you.

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:38.663
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:40.050
 ANNOUNCER: Unbelievable!

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.600
Wayne Gretzky, the
greatest scorer ever

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.970
in the history of the NHL!

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:48.520
 If you have a love and
a passion for something,

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.810
the rewards are endless.

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:50.568
[CHEERING]

00:00:50.568 --> 00:00:54.480
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:57.620
This is MasterClass.

